### Harness for JetBrains IDEs — uses the built-in HTTP Client (no plugin to compile).
### Variables come from http-client.env.json (urls) and http-client.private.env.json (token; never commit).
### Run requests with the gutter icon. Plan approval changes what the agent may execute: read before sending.

### Who am I
GET {{identity}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Projects visible to my team
GET {{identity}}/api/v1/projects?limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Code sessions for a project
GET {{workflow}}/api/v1/developer-workflow/code-sessions?projectId={{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change sets in a code session
GET {{workflow}}/api/v1/developer-workflow/code-sessions/{{sessionId}}/change-sets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Accept or reject one hunk
POST {{workflow}}/api/v1/developer-workflow/change-sets/{{changeSetId}}/decisions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decisions": [{"path": "{{path}}", "hunkId": "h0", "decision": "accept"}]}

### Merge-readiness evidence (evidence only — Harness never merges)
GET {{workflow}}/api/v1/developer-workflow/code-sessions/{{sessionId}}/merge-checks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Run status
GET {{orchestrator}}/api/v1/orchestrator/runs/{{runId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approve a plan (irreversible for the run)
POST {{orchestrator}}/api/v1/orchestrator/runs/{{runId}}/plan/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"planId": "{{planId}}"}
